1072 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 315 0 R
/T (Conclusion:  This experiment demonstrates the development of a complete and visually attractive Pet Shop website  using HTML and CSS.  Using HTML, various webpages such as Home, Products, Cart, About Us, Contact, Registration, and  Login pages are designed to provide essential functionality for customers and administrators.  Using CSS, the website layout is enhanced with responsive design techniques, CSS Grid layouts,  spacing, colors, fonts, and styling effects to improve usability and appearance.  The project helps in understanding the practical implementation of frontend web development  technologies and strengthens concepts related to webpage structuring, styling, responsiveness, and  user interface design.  This experiment also provides a strong foundation for developing advanced full-stack web  applications in future projects. )
/E (Conclusion:  This experiment demonstrates the development of a complete and visually attractive Pet Shop website  using HTML and CSS.  Using HTML, various webpages such as Home, Products, Cart, About Us, Contact, Registration, and  Login pages are designed to provide essential functionality for customers and administrators.  Using CSS, the website layout is enhanced with responsive design techniques, CSS Grid layouts,  spacing, colors, fonts, and styling effects to improve usability and appearance.  The project helps in understanding the practical implementation of frontend web development  technologies and strengthens concepts related to webpage structuring, styling, responsiveness, and  user interface design.  This experiment also provides a strong foundation for developing advanced full-stack web  applications in future projects. )
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
